{"3631230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CastleMiner Z : Resurrection", "steam_appid": 3631230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CastleMiner Z is back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rebuilt from the ground up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</strong> is an open-world survival shooter where guns, blocks, and dragons collide. Explore massive procedurally generated worlds, from scorched deserts to frozen wastelands, as you mine resources, craft powerful gear, build fortified bases, and fight to survive against relentless hordes and fire-breathing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is more than a remaster. Every biome, enemy, and weapon has been completely reimagined in <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, delivering modern visuals, smarter AI, and deeper progression systems. Dig deep for rare ores, construct towering strongholds, and adapt your strategy as the world pushes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two worlds are ever the same. Every expedition, every build, and every battle creates a new survival story.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631230/extras/2864d8026068de60efea322e4f6ce001.avif?t=1770312274\" width=610 height=3560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CastleMiner Z is back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Rebuilt from the ground up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CastleMiner Z: Resurrection</strong> is an open-